{
  "$schema": "../../docs/builder.schema.json",
  "template": {
    "title": "Freelancer portfolio",
    "description": "For a designer, developer or photographer: what you do, your skills, your work and a way to hire you."
  },
  "version": 1,
  "layout": "site",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "sx082",
      "type": "section",
      "style": {
        "padding": {
          "base": "xl",
          "mobile": "lg"
        },
        "text": "center",
        "width": "narrow"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx083",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wa079",
              "type": "animated-headline",
              "tag": "h1",
              "size": "2xl",
              "before": {
                "id": "Halo, saya membantu Anda",
                "en": "Hi, I help you"
              },
              "words": {
                "id": "merancang\nmembangun\nmengembangkan",
                "en": "design\nbuild\ngrow"
              },
              "after": {
                "id": "produk digital.",
                "en": "digital products."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt080",
              "type": "text",
              "html": {
                "id": "<p>Perkenalkan diri Anda dalam satu atau dua kalimat: keahlian, pengalaman, dan klien yang biasa Anda bantu.</p>",
                "en": "<p>Introduce yourself in one or two lines: your skills, experience and the clients you usually help.</p>"
              },
              "size": "lg"
            },
            {
              "id": "wb081",
              "type": "button",
              "buttons": [
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Lihat karya",
                    "en": "See my work"
                  },
                  "url": "#karya"
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Ajak kerja sama",
                    "en": "Hire me"
                  },
                  "url": "#kontak",
                  "variant": "outline"
                }
              ],
              "size": "lg"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx086",
      "type": "section",
      "style": {
        "text": "center"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx087",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wh084",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Yang saya kerjakan",
                "en": "What I do"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wi085",
              "type": "icon-box",
              "columns": "3",
              "variant": "outline",
              "items": [
                {
                  "icon": "target",
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Desain UI/UX",
                    "en": "UI/UX design"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Tampilan yang mudah dipakai dan enak dilihat.",
                    "en": "Interfaces that are easy to use and pleasant to look at."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "icon": "code",
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Pengembangan web",
                    "en": "Web development"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Situs cepat yang mudah Anda kelola sendiri.",
                    "en": "Fast sites you can manage yourself."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "icon": "rocket",
                  "title": {
                    "id": "Strategi digital",
                    "en": "Digital strategy"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Rencana yang jelas untuk tumbuh secara online.",
                    "en": "A clear plan to grow online."
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx091",
      "type": "section",
      "style": {
        "background": "muted",
        "valign": "center"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx092",
          "width": {
            "base": 6,
            "tablet": 12
          },
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wh088",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Keahlian",
                "en": "Skills"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt089",
              "type": "text",
              "html": {
                "id": "<p>Sesuaikan daftar ini dengan keahlian Anda.</p>",
                "en": "<p>Adjust this list to your own skills.</p>"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cx093",
          "width": {
            "base": 6,
            "tablet": 12
          },
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wp090",
              "type": "progress",
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Desain",
                    "en": "Design"
                  },
                  "percent": 90
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "HTML & CSS",
                    "en": "HTML & CSS"
                  },
                  "percent": 85
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "JavaScript",
                    "en": "JavaScript"
                  },
                  "percent": 75,
                  "color": "brand-secondary"
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Fotografi",
                    "en": "Photography"
                  },
                  "percent": 60,
                  "color": "brand-accent"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx097",
      "type": "section",
      "anchor": "karya",
      "style": {
        "text": "center"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx098",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wh094",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Karya terbaru",
                "en": "Recent work"
              },
              "kicker": {
                "id": "Portofolio",
                "en": "Portfolio"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt095",
              "type": "text",
              "html": {
                "id": "<p>Karya diambil dari artikel yang punya gambar utama. Tulis satu artikel untuk setiap proyek.</p>",
                "en": "<p>Work comes from articles with a featured image. Write one article for each project.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wp096",
              "type": "portfolio",
              "count": 6,
              "columns": "3"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx101",
      "type": "section",
      "style": {
        "background": "muted",
        "text": "center"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx102",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wh099",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Kata klien",
                "en": "What clients say"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wr100",
              "type": "reviews",
              "per_view": "2",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Hasilnya melebihi harapan, komunikasinya lancar.",
                    "en": "Better than we hoped, and easy to work with."
                  },
                  "name": "Andi",
                  "role": {
                    "id": "Pemilik usaha",
                    "en": "Business owner"
                  },
                  "rating": "5"
                },
                {
                  "text": {
                    "id": "Cepat tanggap dan detail.",
                    "en": "Responsive and thorough."
                  },
                  "name": "Maya",
                  "role": {
                    "id": "Manajer pemasaran",
                    "en": "Marketing manager"
                  },
                  "rating": "5"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx106",
      "type": "section",
      "anchor": "kontak",
      "style": {
        "width": "narrow"
      },
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "cx107",
          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "wh103",
              "type": "heading",
              "text": {
                "id": "Punya proyek?",
                "en": "Have a project?"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wt104",
              "type": "text",
              "html": {
                "id": "<p>Ceritakan sedikit tentang proyek Anda, saya akan membalas secepatnya.</p>",
                "en": "<p>Tell me a little about your project and I will reply soon.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wf105",
              "type": "form",
              "name": "Proyek",
              "fields": [
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Nama",
                    "en": "Name"
                  },
                  "kind": "text",
                  "required": true,
                  "width": "half"
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Email",
                    "en": "Email"
                  },
                  "kind": "email",
                  "required": true,
                  "width": "half"
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Anggaran",
                    "en": "Budget"
                  },
                  "kind": "radio",
                  "options": {
                    "id": "< Rp 5 juta\nRp 5 - 15 juta\n> Rp 15 juta",
                    "en": "< $500\n$500 - $1,500\n> $1,500"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": {
                    "id": "Ceritakan proyek Anda",
                    "en": "About your project"
                  },
                  "kind": "textarea",
                  "required": true
                }
              ],
              "submit": {
                "id": "Kirim",
                "en": "Send"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
